00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:30.790
May This Voice Reach Kamogawa

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:30.210
An unexpected factor must've slipped in during the fusion

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.000
of Lady Yurikano and Madoka Kyouno's personalities,

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.380
which may have caused this anomaly.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:35.880
I'll hear your explanation later.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:39.010
Get Yurikano off the ship to safety.

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:42.850
Huh? No way.

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:45.100
Are you Miss Yurikano?

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:47.600
Does this mean we're...

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:50.230
Madoka, come on!

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:51.060
Wait, I'm not...

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:51.850
I'm...

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:53.270
Miss Yurikano can wait!

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:54.900
Right now, we have to run!

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:55.690
No, listen to me!

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:01.160
You two, halt!

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:03.120
H-Hey, wait!

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:05.830
I'm over here, Muginami!

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.540
It's too dangerous to remain on board!

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:09.960
You must head to the escape pod immediately!

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.670
Huh? Escape?!

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:14.000
King Dizelmine's orders!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.210
We will escort you, Lady Yurikano.

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:18.170
Just a minute! You have the wrong person.

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:19.880
I'm not Miss Yurikano...

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:24.930
No, wait!

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:26.310
There's something I have to tell you!

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:27.640
We must hurry.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.730
Oh, come on, listen!

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:32.230
You... and you... and you...

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:35.270
All of you, I'm telling you to stop!

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:42.320
<i>The surrounding energy field is in flux.</i>

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:45.490
Could that be what's causing the anomaly on Dizelmine's ship?

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:46.530
<i>Doesn't matter.</i>

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:49.660
We came here to get Yurikano back.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.410
What happens to the Le Garite vessel is none of our concern—

00:03:58.250 --> 00:03:59.000
How many?

00:03:59.000 --> 00:03:59.960
Three!

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:01.840
The Eques are about to intercept them.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:04.300
This anomaly on the ship...

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:07.800
It could be the result of them using a new weapon against us...

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:11.100
Send out every Ovid we have available to attack.

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:11.810
Yes, sir!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.390
Have you secured Princess Laffinty?

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:15.850
Negative!

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:21.240
Where could Madoka and Muginami be?

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:27.240
<i>Currently unable to guarantee that the launch systems will function properly.</i>

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:30.490
<i>All Ovids are to launch using manual launch protocols.</i>

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:31.830
<i>Repeat: Currently... </i>

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:38.590
<i>Our sensors have picked up multiple Ovid launches from Dizelmine's ship.</i>

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:43.470
<i>Are you still going to tell me that this war is just between you and Dizelmine, sir?</i>

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:45.050
Do as you wish...

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.510
<i>Don't mind if I do.</i>

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:49.680
Scramble all squadrons!

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:51.890
Protect King Villagiulio!

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.020
<i>Roger!</i>

00:04:58.230 --> 00:04:59.690
<i>Just don't get in my way!</i>

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:04.950
Wait! I have to return to that lab!

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:06.410
Are you crazy?!

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:11.660
My appearance in this world has to be the cause of this anomaly!

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:15.210
I must use the Vox Core and return beyond the Rin-ne immediately!

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:20.170
What's gotten into you, Madoka?!

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:22.050
Was it something you ate?!

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:23.010
I keep telling you, I'm not...

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:28.300
Oh! At the reception, your meal must've been laced with some nasty drug!

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:30.890
Damn you, Le Garite!

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:33.100
Madoka?!

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:36.600
Listen to me!

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:39.690
I'm not Miss Yurikano...

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:41.440
Hold on, this is my chance!

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:46.530
That's right. My name is Yurikano.

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:48.860
I may not look it, but I am the princess of De Metrio.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:52.370
I, the most regal one, hereby command you.{now all of you... die!}

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:56.250
I wish to have an audience with Lan's brother immediately!

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:01.130
No! King Dizelmine's orders have priority!

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:02.880
What?!

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:23.150
Another Le Garite craft?

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:25.360
No! The readings are different!

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:26.900
<i>Is it Villagiulio?!</i>

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:28.650
It's not him either.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:31.410
Hey, those are...

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:35.990
I need to stop this fighting quickly...

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:48.420
Orca!

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:52.510
Madoka! Where are you?!

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:12.950
Thank you, Hupo!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.960
First, we detect a powerful energy field...

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.960
and then, the Voxes just flew off by themselves.

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:10.880
What the hell's going on up there?

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:13.930
Dizelmine must've done something.

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:18.100
The observed origin of the anomaly was the Le Garite flagship.

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:20.850
Lympha and Ignis link-ups confirmed.

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:24.770
Which means Lan and Muginami are safe.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:25.810
What about Aura?!

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:29.860
Well, the signal indicates it has made contact with its pilot.

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:32.030
But it's as if...

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:32.740
What is it?

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:36.740
Aura appears to be confused.

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:39.120
What does that mean?

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:46.210
I see. So you're her...

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:50.500
Listen, I need your help!

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:53.260
Take me to the laboratory division of this ship.

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:57.300
Huh?!

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:59.180
Hey, come back!

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:02.270
I should've known...

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:05.810
The Vox won't respond unless both mind and body are one and the same.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:08.980
That's...

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:11.650
I said...

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:15.650
I must see Lan's brother to tell him something!

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:18.110
Wait! Hold on!

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:39.760
There are too many of them. We'll never get through.

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:41.180
<i>Quit whining!</i>

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:44.520
If we survive this, we can make it to Dizelmine's ship!

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:46.140
But that anomaly...

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.770
If we don't hurry, Yurikano's life will be in danger.

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.770
<i>Watch your six, Kirius!</i>

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:04.160
Why did that Le Garite Ovid save me?!

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:06.250
<i>Grow a pair, Kirius!</i>

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:09.040
<i>Didn't I teach you that it's not the enemy,</i>

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.750
<i>but your own carelessness that trips you up?</i>

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.540
Is that you, Kyouno?

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:14.050
<i>You guys know her?</i>

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:15.920
Madoka, why are you here?

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.590
<i>I'm Yurikano!</i>

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:20.050
<i>One thing led to another, so right now, I'm in her body.</i>

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:23.890
{Hey, that's taking the joke too far!}C'mon, your joke's gone on long enough!

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:25.770
<i>I'm not joking! Trust me!</i>

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:30.560
Indeed, that advice just now was something Yurikano said to me countless times.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:35.320
And Madoka wouldn't know our tactical radio frequency.

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:37.690
You really expect me to believe that?!

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:39.950
<i>What about that time during the Academy's drill camp?!</i>

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:44.030
<i>I was bathing when I saw a grotesque mouse... </i>

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:50.670
<i>and... and clung to you while completely naked!</i>

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:53.040
She's the real deal.

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:54.750
But how in the world?!

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:56.380
I'll explain in full detail later!

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:58.720
First, let's take out those guys!

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:00.630
Don't go on the defensive!

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:02.840
Drive a wedge into their formation before you're surrounded!

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:04.260
Maintain your attack!

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:06.930
Follow me!

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:08.060
Roger!

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:10.480
Roger!

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.650
Roger!

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:21.150
Clear the way!

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:23.450
Yahoo!

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:27.040
Is that our Ovid? Who's piloting it?

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:28.080
We don't know.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.500
What we do know is that the pilot is extremely skilled.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.330
Our standard squadron is no match.

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:47.470
It took me an entire minute just to deal with those lousy fighters.

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:50.810
Have my skills dulled from being inside the Rin-ne?

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:00.280
Their elite squadron, huh?!

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:06.870
<i>I'll cover for you, Yurikano!</i>

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:08.080
Stay back, Array!

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:23.380
Wipe them out!

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:31.470
<i>Brother!</i>

00:12:31.470 --> 00:12:32.600
Huh?! Madoka...

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:33.810
<i>No!</i>

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:35.940
You believed that even royalty should know how to cook for themselves.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:37.940
I used to always cook by eyeballing the ingredients,

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:40.320
and then you'd eat my food and tell me about the importance

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:41.780
of measuring and taste testing!

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:43.070
I'm your sister!

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:45.660
Yurikano?!

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:52.540
I wonder if this place has any food.

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:55.210
It'd be nice if they had some fish-flavored crackers.{fucking disgusting}

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:58.250
A bottle of Kamogawa Energy to go with them would just be perfect.

00:12:58.790 --> 00:12:59.460
Found it!

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:03.210
Huh? Is this all?!

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:07.720
I'm going to die of hunger before I get to Le Garite.

00:13:08.340 --> 00:13:10.100
But before that happens,

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:13.770
I wish there was some way for me to tell Lan's brother and Giuvi

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:15.690
that {being }Miss Yurikano is suffering.

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:16.230
Oh!

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:19.110
But I wonder why she doesn't want to tell them herself?

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:22.030
I <i>so</i> don't get i— Ouch!

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:23.070
Owie...

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:34.580
Where's that bastard Dizel?

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.830
If his ship's so smashed that he can't come out,

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.830
I'll go and meet him from my side!

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:43.510
No!

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:44.920
I won't let you!

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:46.420
Muginami...

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:51.300
<i>I, Fin E Ld Si Laffinty, Princess of Le Garite, command you!</i>{now all of you... die! swear to god, _______ command you reminds me so much of code gayass}

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:56.810
<i>Stand down immediately and lock down your armament and battle control systems!</i>

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.520
You too, Big Brother!

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:01.020
<i>Don't be ridiculous.</i>

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:03.190
<i>What do you mean by "Big Brother"?!</i>

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:06.690
Madoka?! What're you doing here?

00:14:06.690 --> 00:14:10.490
<i>I keep telling you, I'm not her! I'm Yurikano!</i>

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:12.910
Brother, what have you done to Makoka?

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:14.620
<i>Don't look at me with such sadness in your eyes!</i>

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:19.710
What can I do to make you people believe me?!

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:27.090
<i>S-Sweet-and-sour pork... E-Edible hot chili oil... Y-Y... </i>

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:28.260
Is that the emergency frequency?

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:31.470
<i>I really don't get why Miss Yurikano doesn't want to tell</i>

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:33.680
<i>Lan's brother and Big Brother Giuvi how she feels.</i>

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:38.230
<i>If she tells them, they might even understand...</i>

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:38.980
Huh?

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:43.480
<i>Th-Thick noodle pasta?</i>

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:46.150
<i>T-Taramo salad... </i>

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:46.780
Huh?

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:49.280
That's Madoka!

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:53.070
I mean, it sounds pretty simple enough to me.

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:54.620
But no...

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:59.250
She has to take her sweet time like a girl hesitating to confess her love.

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:01.580
L... Lo... Love.

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:04.590
B... Bou... Bouillabaisse.

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:07.590
I... I... love you.

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:11.890
I... I'm... in love... with you...

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:16.850
Wait a second.

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:19.640
No way!

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:23.350
<i>Yurikano loves Lan's brother?!</i>

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:31.200
<i>I see. Yurikano couldn't endure it.</i>

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:34.240
<i>She couldn't bear seeing her brother and the man she loved</i>

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:37.080
<i>fighting and hating each other.</i>{yes! the time to strike at the head of the beast will soon be upon us! let anger and hatred guide your blows!}

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:43.170
Sacrificing herself was much less painful.

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.380
That's why...

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:48.920
I ate the last of the rations.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:54.430
If some day, if I could meet Lan's brother again...

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:57.560
I want to tell him how you feel.

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:01.430
But it looks like that day will never come.

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:05.100
Goodbye, Lan...

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:07.770
Goodbye, Muginami...

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:10.230
Goodbye, everybody in Kamogawa...

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:13.700
Goodbye, Earth...

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:23.330
Everybody! I'm back!

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:25.500
You saved me, Midori!

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:26.750
Huh?

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:29.050
Why won't you respond to my commands?

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:31.090
Is it because I'm not my usual self?

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:33.590
<i>Hey! Midori!</i>

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:53.360
Oww...

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:56.610
Yurikano... No, right now, you're Miss Madoka, aren't you?

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:01.830
I heard everything you said through the escape pod's communications.

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:02.540
What?!

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:06.460
Being able to fly Aura implies you have indeed swapped places with her.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:21.470
I'm back in my own body.

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:23.470
Lan? Muginami?

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:24.180
<i>Madoka?</i>

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:24.730
<i>Huh?</i>

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:27.730
<i>Madoka, I thought you were in the escape pod.</i>

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:30.730
Then the one who's there now is...

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:35.530
When I see the flowers of Lagrange{OMG THAT'S THE SHOW'S TITLE!!!} in full bloom like this,

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:36.450
it takes me back...

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:40.950
...to the day when Yurikano became my betrothed.

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:45.460
We were so little that we hardly knew the meaning of that word.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:49.960
But we were entrusted to become the shining example

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:54.630
to inspire Le Garite and De Metrio to work together and move forward.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:05.890
As time passed, our two planets parted ways,

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:10.310
and in a similar manner, the ties that bound us were severed.

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:19.320
Even then, the love I felt for her never faded.

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:23.200
To this day, I still love Yurikano.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:26.580
That is why my heart aches.

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:34.170
This chaos is necessary for the 100 billion citizens of Polyhedron.

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:37.720
To think that the one you love would not understand.

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:38.970
Villagiulio!

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:40.840
<i>Go to them!</i>

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:53.020
I don't want to hate Yurikano.

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:56.650
I want her to share my feelings.

00:18:57.280 --> 00:19:00.950
If she really does love me...

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:03.410
Why don't you ask her directly?

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:06.990
Miss Madoka?

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:11.580
This is your chance. Tell her how you feel.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:15.290
Then... you're the real...

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:17.460
Liar...

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:18.920
Huh?

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:23.340
I think you're...

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:26.720
despicable!

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:30.810
Ah... That felt good!

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:31.980
Miss Yurikano?

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:33.520
Don't get the wrong idea!

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:35.940
I would never love a man like him!

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:39.360
So go right ahead and hate me.

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:45.160
If it means this world won't be buried in sorrow...

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:49.160
If that's what it takes...

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.500
Then I...

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:58.250
I... will let go of you.

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:13.480
Honestly, don't you think all men are fools?

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:17.190
That includes Dizelmine.

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:18.650
Yurikano!

00:20:20.480 --> 00:20:21.780
And my brother.

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.210
If we ever meet again...

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:36.040
If by some miracle that should happen...

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:39.750
Let's have a nice, long chat, okay, Madoka?

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:42.010
We'll meet again. Definitely!

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:18.420
Yeah...

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:21.170
Let's definitely meet again.

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:24.470
I'll come to see you, Yurikano.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:40.110
All right, you two...

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:50.070
You have a lot to answer for!

